      "extract": "The unification of the WRT invariants was initiated in 2006 by Habiro. For any integral homology 3--sphere $M$, Habiro \\cite{Ha} constructed a {\\em unified invariant} $J_M$ whose evaluation at any root of unity coincides with the value of the WRT invariant at that root. Habiro's unified invariant $J_M$ is an element of the following ring (Habiro's ring) \\[ \\Habiro:=\\lim_{\\overleftarrow{\\hspace{2mm}k\\hspace{2mm}}}",
