      "extract": "By Kirby theorem, any link invariant which does not change under Kirby moves is an invariant of a 3--manifold given by surgery on that link. Let us first recall what the Kirby moves are. \\newcommand{\\tL}{\\tilde L} \\vskip2mm {\\noindent \\bf K1--Move} (handle slide): For some $i\\neq j$, replace the $i$th component $L_i$ with $L'_i$, a band connected sum of $L_i$ with a push off of $L_j$ (defined by the framing), with",
